WEBVTT

00:00:22.180 --> 00:00:23.850
That look!

00:00:23.850 --> 00:00:26.850
That look in your eyes!

00:00:26.850 --> 00:00:31.020
That woman... You're under
that witch's spell!!

00:00:36.700 --> 00:00:42.200
<i>That's how it always starts...</i>
<i>under the azure sky</i>

00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:49.370
<i>After making a vow,</i>
<i>I now set off</i>

00:01:01.990 --> 00:01:08.500
<i>Yeah, the desert glitters with a golden hue</i>
<i>(The wind is scorching)</i>

00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:14.840
<i>I'm searching for a diamond flower</i>
<i>(I keep on wandering)</i>

00:01:14.840 --> 00:01:21.180
<i>Now, for the first time in my life,</i>

00:01:21.180 --> 00:01:27.520
<i>I live for someone else</i>

00:01:27.520 --> 00:01:34.020
<i>There's something</i>
<i>I wanna protect</i>

00:01:34.020 --> 00:01:40.530
<i>I'll never,</i>
<i>ever lose it again</i>

00:01:40.530 --> 00:01:43.530
<i>Resound,</i>
<i>my heartbeat!</i>

00:01:43.530 --> 00:01:53.530
<i>A heartbeat smaller and fragile,</i>
<i>but tougher than anyone's.</i>

00:02:06.650 --> 00:02:10.220
"Lonely Cat"

00:03:20.830 --> 00:03:22.990
Y- you...

00:03:24.500 --> 00:03:26.830
You're one of Chronos' henchmen?

00:03:29.830 --> 00:03:32.500
I've come to bring you bad luck...

00:03:48.190 --> 00:03:53.020
Splendid...
You're amazing, Black Cat...

00:04:02.470 --> 00:04:05.960
We have confirmed
the death of the target.

00:04:09.470 --> 00:04:13.140
Good work, No. XIII.

00:04:13.140 --> 00:04:16.810
I commend you for your
very skillful work on this job.

00:04:16.810 --> 00:04:22.820
With that dictator out of the way,
the village will be peaceful once more.

00:04:22.820 --> 00:04:25.160
Now, let us move straight
onto your next mission.

00:04:25.160 --> 00:04:29.490
This job is a bit difficult,
but I think you will do fine.

00:04:29.490 --> 00:04:33.660
I probably don't have to say this,
but this is also a secret mission.

00:04:33.660 --> 00:04:35.830
Make sure you aren't seen...

00:04:35.830 --> 00:04:38.860
Ask Sephiria about the details.

00:04:42.170 --> 00:04:45.580
Train Heartnet, I'll explain
the details of your mission.

00:04:51.520 --> 00:04:54.190
Lib-<i>sama</i>!

00:04:54.190 --> 00:04:55.780
Peace for our town!

00:05:02.790 --> 00:05:05.460
Governor? Don't make
me laugh, you thug.

00:05:05.460 --> 00:05:09.300
Extortion, drug dealing, murder...

00:05:09.300 --> 00:05:12.300
And after committing all those crimes
you end up becoming a politician?

00:05:12.300 --> 00:05:14.310
There's no way I'll let you
get away with this.

00:05:14.310 --> 00:05:18.210
You just wait. I'll have you
locked up in no time.

00:05:20.310 --> 00:05:24.980
Damn, if I don't take him into custody soon,
I'm gonna starve to death...

00:05:24.980 --> 00:05:29.820
Spaghetti Neapolitan,
club sandwich, pancake set...

00:05:29.820 --> 00:05:32.820
Everything's so damn expensive!

00:05:32.820 --> 00:05:34.690
Welcome...

00:05:37.830 --> 00:05:39.830
This is a non-smoking section.

00:05:39.830 --> 00:05:41.170
What?

00:05:41.170 --> 00:05:42.830
Here's your coffee.

00:05:42.830 --> 00:05:44.500
Thanks!

00:05:44.500 --> 00:05:46.170
Keep the change.

00:05:46.170 --> 00:05:48.170
Thank you very much!

00:05:48.170 --> 00:05:49.510
It's the exact amount, though.

00:05:49.510 --> 00:05:50.340
Gee, thanks.

00:05:52.180 --> 00:05:54.510
Shall I bring you
something to eat?

00:05:54.510 --> 00:05:58.970
N- no, thanks. Well, you see,
um... I'm on a diet, so...

00:06:05.460 --> 00:06:08.130
Mister, where did you come from?

00:06:08.130 --> 00:06:09.460
Can you guess?

00:06:09.460 --> 00:06:12.300
Sightseeing...
no, that can't be it.

00:06:12.300 --> 00:06:14.970
Oh, I got it! You wandered here
looking to get a little piece of the action

00:06:14.970 --> 00:06:17.130
from the governor's
inauguration, didn't you?

00:06:17.130 --> 00:06:18.140
A piece?

00:06:18.140 --> 00:06:21.810
We've been getting a lot of those
types lately. They're a nuisance.

00:06:21.810 --> 00:06:24.810
Hmm... Yeah, it doesn't look like
there're any gentlemen around here.

00:06:24.810 --> 00:06:26.480
A gentleman?
What's that?

00:06:26.480 --> 00:06:29.810
A man who never forgets
his manners or his pride...

00:06:29.810 --> 00:06:31.650
A Nice Guy!

00:06:34.320 --> 00:06:38.160
Not like I care, but if you stick
to a policy like that in this town,

00:06:38.160 --> 00:06:40.560
they'll make Swiss cheese
of you within 5 minutes.

00:06:41.830 --> 00:06:43.660
I mean, really...

00:06:43.660 --> 00:06:46.500
Having a gangster for a governor?
What is the world coming to?

00:06:51.840 --> 00:06:53.840
P- please stop it!

00:06:53.840 --> 00:06:55.330
Those guys again!

00:06:56.840 --> 00:06:58.840
Here I come!

00:06:58.840 --> 00:07:00.180
What's up with this bitch!?

00:07:00.180 --> 00:07:01.180
What'd you say!?

00:07:01.180 --> 00:07:03.450
Hey, while we're at it,
why don't we feel up this bitch, too?

00:07:03.450 --> 00:07:05.780
--Yeah!
--H- hey, stop it!

00:07:05.780 --> 00:07:08.450
--Oh, she smells good!
--Stop it!

00:07:08.450 --> 00:07:11.120
Keep your paws off us!
This isn't that kind of place!

00:07:11.120 --> 00:07:12.790
Then, let's make it
that kind of place.

00:07:12.790 --> 00:07:16.130
--S- stop it!
--Let her go, you perv!

00:07:16.130 --> 00:07:17.460
You shouldn't talk
like that, you know?

00:07:17.460 --> 00:07:19.360
Hey, give her a break,
'cause she hates us!

00:07:22.800 --> 00:07:24.390
Huh? What the heck is this?

00:07:25.470 --> 00:07:28.470
Have some candy
and behave yourselves, boys.

00:07:28.470 --> 00:07:31.480
Now be good boys
and back away from the ladies.

00:07:31.480 --> 00:07:32.810
--What!?
--What!?

00:07:32.810 --> 00:07:37.480
Good, that's more like it.
I'll give you each one more as a reward.

00:07:42.820 --> 00:07:44.660
Those're nano-machines.

00:07:44.660 --> 00:07:50.160
They enter your body and will burn you
from the inside using 1000-degree heat...

00:07:50.160 --> 00:07:52.060
Just kidding.
Don't worry.

00:07:52.060 --> 00:07:55.160
They're "Gentleman's special
jalapeño candy". They won't kill you.

00:07:56.830 --> 00:07:58.840
All right, chow down!

00:07:58.840 --> 00:08:00.340
Whoa!
What a feast!

00:08:00.340 --> 00:08:03.440
I'll put it on your tab for you.

00:08:03.440 --> 00:08:04.780
You're charging me?

00:08:04.780 --> 00:08:05.770
Yep!

00:08:12.120 --> 00:08:16.620
Live or die,
I'll let you choose.

00:08:16.620 --> 00:08:22.790
Train, I saw your work...
You're amazing!

00:08:22.790 --> 00:08:26.130
Your unwavering bullet
shot right through his vital parts.

00:08:26.130 --> 00:08:28.130
It is surely art.

00:08:28.130 --> 00:08:31.800
You and I are the only ones
who can kill like that.

00:08:31.800 --> 00:08:35.970
You're truly amazing,
Train Heartnet!

00:09:07.270 --> 00:09:10.610
I beg of you...
Please don't kill me...

00:09:10.610 --> 00:09:12.010
Please!

00:09:19.780 --> 00:09:21.270
There's no more left...

00:09:29.130 --> 00:09:33.060
Live or die,
I'll let you choose.

00:09:46.810 --> 00:09:49.210
Just as I expected, it doesn't
look like I can do it outside...

00:09:53.150 --> 00:09:56.150
I'm Lib Tyrant.

00:09:56.150 --> 00:10:00.820
I've become the new governor
thanks to your support.

00:10:00.820 --> 00:10:05.160
God bless all those
who supported me!

00:10:05.160 --> 00:10:07.650
<i>As expected,</i>
<i>the security's tight here...</i>

00:10:12.840 --> 00:10:15.170
Ooops, it slipped...

00:10:15.170 --> 00:10:16.500
Sorry...

00:10:19.180 --> 00:10:23.680
This great day will be forever engraved
in history as the day that I, Lib,

00:10:23.680 --> 00:10:27.520
brought peace to this land...

00:10:27.520 --> 00:10:31.010
<i>Looks like my chance is when</i>
<i>the governor leaves his seat...</i>

00:10:45.870 --> 00:10:48.540
What an unfriendly brat...

00:10:48.540 --> 00:10:51.540
Now, I'd like to make
an announcement to everyone.

00:10:51.540 --> 00:10:55.210
I'd like to introduce you
to my fiancée, Joanna.

00:10:55.210 --> 00:10:59.550
We're going to get
married next month!

00:10:59.550 --> 00:11:05.160
Just like our love, the peace in
Blakio City is forever indestructible!

00:11:05.160 --> 00:11:07.830
Peace for our land,
and Lib for your governor!

00:11:07.830 --> 00:11:11.160
I, Lib Tyrant, aim to serve
as your governor for a long time!

00:11:11.160 --> 00:11:12.930
Hail Governor Lib!

00:11:15.170 --> 00:11:16.860
Marrying a gangster, huh?

00:11:18.500 --> 00:11:19.490
Hurrah!

00:11:26.510 --> 00:11:28.670
Geez, what a pain in the ass...

00:11:58.210 --> 00:12:01.980
L... Lib's gonna be killed?

00:12:49.860 --> 00:12:51.530
There's no mistaking it...

00:12:51.530 --> 00:12:55.760
My right eye, the "vision eye",
foresaw what'll happen 5 minutes from now...

00:12:58.540 --> 00:13:01.370
In 5 minutes, Lib won't be
with us any longer...

00:13:06.480 --> 00:13:10.470
I have to take Lib into custody
before he comes...

00:13:12.150 --> 00:13:13.820
Don't move!

00:13:13.820 --> 00:13:15.650
Who are you?

00:13:16.820 --> 00:13:19.660
Just don't get tough
with a tax payer.

00:13:19.660 --> 00:13:20.990
H- hey! Wait!

00:13:25.830 --> 00:13:30.200
<i>Shit! The "vision eye"</i>
<i>really uses a lot of energy!</i>

00:13:38.180 --> 00:13:40.580
Sorry! I'm in a hurry...

00:13:46.180 --> 00:13:48.990
<i>Looks like Lib's</i>
<i>security's still tight...</i>

00:13:48.990 --> 00:13:50.480
<i>Two more minutes...</i>

00:14:05.470 --> 00:14:08.140
<i>Time is running out...</i>

00:14:08.140 --> 00:14:14.480
<i>He's definitely in this hall...</i>
<i>The assassin who's after Lib...</i>

00:14:14.480 --> 00:14:20.820
<i>But, is it really possible for him</i>
<i>to kill Lib while he's in this hall?</i>

00:14:20.820 --> 00:14:25.490
<i>Even if he could kill Lib,</i>
<i>there's no way for him to escape...</i>

00:14:25.490 --> 00:14:28.230
<i>No, instead of thinking</i>
<i>about the assassin,</i>

00:14:28.230 --> 00:14:32.490
<i>I'd better think about how to take Lib</i>
<i>into custody with the seconds that remain.</i>

00:14:33.830 --> 00:14:37.170
<i>Thanks to the use of my "vision eye"</i>
<i>earlier, I'm completely exhausted...</i>

00:14:37.170 --> 00:14:40.500
<i>There's no way I can overpower</i>
<i>Lib's bodyguards...</i>

00:14:40.500 --> 00:14:42.840
<i>and I've already used</i>
<i>the sleeping gas...</i>

00:14:42.840 --> 00:14:45.240
<i>Is there any way I can come out</i>
<i>ahead in this situation?</i>

00:14:45.240 --> 00:14:47.840
<i>No, I can't be discouraged...</i>

00:14:47.840 --> 00:14:51.480
<i>If I fail in this job,</i>
<i>I won't be able to pay the car loan.</i>

00:14:51.480 --> 00:14:52.880
<i>On top of not being able to eat,</i>

00:14:52.880 --> 00:14:55.180
<i>I may end up not having</i>
<i>enough money for cigarettes!</i>

00:14:56.520 --> 00:14:57.850
<i>What!?</i>

00:14:59.520 --> 00:15:04.130
Well, then, I'd like to ask the governor
to give us one last comment.

00:15:04.130 --> 00:15:06.150
Governor Lib,
please!

00:15:12.140 --> 00:15:13.070
Shit!

00:15:15.810 --> 00:15:17.100
Damn it!

00:15:19.810 --> 00:15:21.640
This is no joke!

00:15:23.150 --> 00:15:26.320
If I don't get Lib before he does,

00:15:26.320 --> 00:15:29.490
my life will be-!

00:15:29.490 --> 00:15:31.480
Gentleman Dash!!

00:15:36.830 --> 00:15:38.500
Gentleman Net!!

00:15:38.500 --> 00:15:42.500
Oh... Looks like I got caught...

00:15:42.500 --> 00:15:43.490
Rats...

00:16:03.790 --> 00:16:06.620
I've come to bring you bad luck...

00:16:17.800 --> 00:16:19.570
No!!!

00:16:27.810 --> 00:16:29.040
Hold it!

00:16:30.810 --> 00:16:33.480
Why'd you kill him?

00:16:33.480 --> 00:16:37.320
I was going to take him
into custody alive...

00:16:42.490 --> 00:16:46.500
He was a rogue, but you
didn't have to kill him!

00:16:46.500 --> 00:16:49.500
Are you saying that a bad guy
doesn't have the right to live!?

00:16:49.500 --> 00:16:50.330
Get down.

00:17:02.110 --> 00:17:06.450
How dare you kill Lib-<i>sama</i>!
I won't let you out of here alive!

00:17:09.120 --> 00:17:11.450
Die!

00:17:34.140 --> 00:17:37.640
You never saw me...
Got that?

00:17:41.490 --> 00:17:42.980
Bastard! Wait up!

00:17:45.490 --> 00:17:46.980
I lost him...

00:17:49.160 --> 00:17:52.160
Now... are you ready?

00:17:52.160 --> 00:17:56.220
You've made a scratch on that
beautiful face of Train's, so...

00:18:10.450 --> 00:18:11.850
What was that!?

00:18:15.450 --> 00:18:18.120
So it was my stomach
that was screaming, huh?

00:18:18.120 --> 00:18:21.420
I should've eaten
more at the party!

00:18:29.470 --> 00:18:34.140
Engraved roman numerals on his chest?
Then, he's one of the Chrono Numbers.

00:18:34.140 --> 00:18:35.470
Chrono Numbers?

00:18:35.470 --> 00:18:38.480
They're Chronos' erasers.

00:18:38.480 --> 00:18:40.140
Erasers?

00:18:40.140 --> 00:18:43.480
They're the assassins
that belong to Chronos.

00:18:43.480 --> 00:18:45.480
That guy who looked like a kid is-?

00:18:45.480 --> 00:18:50.320
Like a kid? Did you run into him?
What was his number!?

00:18:50.320 --> 00:18:51.820
Number?

00:18:51.820 --> 00:18:54.160
The numeral engraved
on his chest!

00:18:54.160 --> 00:18:55.830
Th- thirteen...

00:18:55.830 --> 00:18:57.160
Get out!

00:18:57.160 --> 00:18:58.500
What's with you all of a sudden?

00:18:58.500 --> 00:19:01.160
Take that and get out already!

00:19:01.160 --> 00:19:03.100
N- no way!
What about the money!?

00:19:03.100 --> 00:19:05.440
You can't get anything
for that beat-up watch!

00:19:05.440 --> 00:19:07.100
This isn't some flea market!

00:19:08.440 --> 00:19:14.780
Come on... I'm trying to get some money
from this to pay my living expenses...

00:19:14.780 --> 00:19:16.780
A black cat...

00:19:16.780 --> 00:19:17.610
Black?

00:19:17.610 --> 00:19:22.790
The thirteenth man
in Chrono Numbers, "Black Cat".

00:19:22.790 --> 00:19:25.590
I've been an information
broker for a long time,

00:19:25.590 --> 00:19:28.730
but I don't know anyone
targeted by him that's still alive...

00:19:28.730 --> 00:19:31.360
"Antiques"
It's a problem if a guy
who has something to do

00:19:31.360 --> 00:19:34.130
with a Grim Reaper like him
comes to my shop!
"Antiques"

00:19:34.130 --> 00:19:36.470
So... you still can't give me
any money for this?

00:19:36.470 --> 00:19:38.940
This isn't some flea market!

00:19:40.800 --> 00:19:43.100
Black Cat, huh?

00:19:46.140 --> 00:19:48.140
It's awfully quiet around here.

00:19:48.140 --> 00:19:51.480
It was good that the gang members
fled town after the governor's death,

00:19:51.480 --> 00:19:54.150
but it's ruining our business...

00:19:54.150 --> 00:19:56.820
So, Mr. Gentleman,
will this be on your tab again?

00:19:56.820 --> 00:19:58.150
Yes...

00:19:58.150 --> 00:19:59.490
What's your occupation?

00:19:59.490 --> 00:20:01.080
I'm a sweeper...

00:20:12.170 --> 00:20:13.660
Dad...

00:20:16.510 --> 00:20:20.600
Dad!! Mom!!

00:21:08.490 --> 00:21:15.830
<i>Let's sing the world's song</i>

00:21:15.830 --> 00:21:22.840
<i>How far shall we go</i>

00:21:22.840 --> 00:21:30.180
<i>Looking up in the sky</i>

00:21:30.180 --> 00:21:37.520
<i>A baby's first cry</i>

00:21:37.520 --> 00:21:44.860
<i>The beating of an insect's wings</i>

00:21:44.860 --> 00:21:51.870
<i>Lightly, lightly, floating...</i>

00:21:51.870 --> 00:21:58.710
<i>Carrying our feelings</i>

00:22:11.950 --> 00:22:17.490
<i>The stars in the night sky</i>
<i>are my tears</i>

00:22:17.490 --> 00:22:21.500
<i>Goddess of the moon,</i>
<i>angel of the stars!</i>

00:22:21.500 --> 00:22:27.270
<i>Please stop time tonight!</i>

00:22:36.180 --> 00:22:42.180
<i>Please show yourself,</i>
<i>even if just a little</i>

00:22:42.180 --> 00:22:47.860
<i>Around the time the first evening star</i>
<i>appears, I hear footsteps approaching</i>

00:22:47.860 --> 00:22:53.860
<i>The only time I can see you</i>
<i>is when the moon is shining</i>

00:22:53.860 --> 00:22:56.870
<i>Please let me dream a little</i>

00:22:56.870 --> 00:23:00.100
<i>'Cause it'll become</i>
<i>an illusion by morning</i>

00:23:00.100 --> 00:23:03.470
<i>Even though I know it,</i>
<i>I still feel lonely</i>

00:23:03.470 --> 00:23:09.140
<i>The stars in the night sky</i>
<i>are my tears</i>

00:23:09.140 --> 00:23:15.150
<i>You held me in your arms</i>
<i>and your passionate lips met mine</i>

00:23:15.150 --> 00:23:18.150
<i>Please don't let go of me</i>

00:23:18.150 --> 00:23:21.490
<i>I'm about to melt in your arms</i>

00:23:21.490 --> 00:23:24.330
<i>But morning is almost here</i>

00:23:24.330 --> 00:23:27.830
<i>Goddess of the moon,</i>
<i>angel of the stars!</i>

00:23:27.830 --> 00:23:34.170
<i>I pray to you,</i>
<i>please stop time</i>

00:23:41.980 --> 00:23:44.980
"Next Episode"
My name is Sven. I'm a sweeper.

00:23:44.980 --> 00:23:48.350
I'm a nice gentleman who'll take on
even the most dangerous of tasks.

00:23:48.350 --> 00:23:49.750
What're you muttering about?

00:23:49.750 --> 00:23:50.520
--What!?
--Oh, yeah!

00:23:50.520 --> 00:23:51.990
Do you want me to divine
your luck with money?

00:23:51.990 --> 00:23:54.190
Lots of people say that my
"coffee divination" often comes true.

00:23:54.190 --> 00:23:55.520
Hey, hey! I didn't ask
for a divination!

00:23:55.520 --> 00:23:57.860
Oh, I see... You don't have
any luck with money,

00:23:57.860 --> 00:23:59.530
but you'll have an encounter
with someone soon...

00:23:59.530 --> 00:24:00.200
Yipes!!

00:24:00.200 --> 00:24:01.530
What is it!?

00:24:01.530 --> 00:24:04.000
Um, some stuff may happen...
well, be careful!

00:24:04.000 --> 00:24:06.970
"Confused Cat"
What did you see!? Hey!!
